        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '- Addons fit into a conduit to change what it can do

        - Open
        the conduit''s hologram and let go of an addon in its addon slot to install
        it. Grab it from the slot to take it out again

        - A conduit holds
        one addon at a time.........................

        - A switch stops power
        crossing its conduit while it''s off. Its capsule handle moves it to another
        side, twists it, or parks it out of the way'
