    - target: {fileID: 3114651368704995631, guid: c67b0677017328ee1865993b2978d535,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Tutorial - Conduits Overview
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6468995164157817124, guid: c67b0677017328ee1865993b2978d535,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '- Conduits allow power to pass from one component to another

        -
        Conduits can be configured to direct the flow of power, or upraded with addons
        to change what they are capable of

        - If a conduit recieves power
        but can''t do anything with it, the power will turn into heat

        -
        Hot coinduits are at increased risk of "popping" and becoming non-functional............'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
